  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 3002.01 “Agent” means “agent” as defined in RSA 287-I:1, I, namely “a party who is authorized by contract or agreement with the commission to conduct a sports book”.\n\nSource. #13041, eff 5-9-20",
